{
  "git": {
    "autoCommit": false,
    "branchPrefix": "feature/"
  },
  "customInstructions": "When planning a new feature:\n1. First analyze if there's an existing implementation - describe what it does, how it works, and when it's triggered\n2. Create a detailed plan file in the plans/ directory\n3. Compare your proposed solution to the existing implementation, explaining differences and improvements\n4. Wait for my approval before implementing\n\nWhen implementing:\n1. Reference the relevant plan file from plan/\n2. Follow the approved approach"
}